        "block_id": "b000069",
        "line": 72,
        "text": "`install.sh` builds, tests, and installs at once in the same manner as iiXml, and installs iiHtmlBlock as macOS, iOS, Android, WASM packages. The compatible root prefix for macOS is `~/.local/SDK/iiHtmlBlock`, and platform-specific packages are placed in `~/.local/SDK/iiHtmlBlock/platforms/<platform>`. After installation, the consuming project can separately add the `iiXml` prefix without using the standard install layout, or can directly import `find_package(iiHtmlBlock CONFIG REQUIRED)` or the install config file `include()`. The root config delegates to the platform package corresponding to the CMake target system to prevent the host dylib from being incorrectly linked in cross-compilation.",
